# portfolio_v2.html is ~269 MB only because the Ravager clip is
# embedded as base64. Planned fix (see CLAUDE.md "Known gaps"): move
# that clip to YouTube, which drops the file to ~17 MB. Once that's
# done, delete the line below and run:  git add claude-md-project/portfolio_v2.html
/claude-md-project/portfolio_v2.html

